            <div xml:id="d6-a4">

                <pb facs="0125" n="17" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg17"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in inclosure 1 in No.
                        13.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gelletich to Mr. Hammond.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consular Agency of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Fiume</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1893-05-20"><hi rendition="#italic">May 20,
                                1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hammond</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">American Consul, Buda-Pesth:</hi></p>
                <p>John Benich, American subject, recruited as soldier; all my protest as consul
                    unavailing. Croatian authority do not want to recognize convention 20th
                    September, 1870. They keep him with soldierly force. Please protest where
                    necessary, and give me prompt instruction. Case urgent.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gelletich.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
